00:11:13.705 --> 00:11:16.726
Oh, it's this Roman snow-blow.


00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.603
Oh, the blizzard that hit Rome.


00:11:18.627 --> 00:11:20.771
Yeah, my cousin's stuck
there for Christmas.


00:11:20.795 --> 00:11:22.814
Oh, this storm's
has wreaked havoc on air


00:11:22.838 --> 00:11:24.566
travel all over the world.


00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:25.817
And in in Christmas.


00:11:25.841 --> 00:11:28.402
Oh, our touring carolers
just heard that flights home


00:11:28.426 --> 00:11:31.072
