if she could.


00:12:31.067 --> 00:12:32.502
Yeah.


00:12:32.526 --> 00:12:34.045
I know.


00:12:34.069 --> 00:12:36.297
I just can't remember the
last time I celebrated


00:12:36.321 --> 00:12:39.133
